# Witherbloom Charm, third mode: "Destroy target nonland permanent with mana value 2 or less". Bot2 has an Island (a land),
# a Basalt Monolith (mana value 3) and a Mox Ruby (0): the Island and the Monolith are refused as targets, the Mox is the
# positive control and is destroyed (CR 115.1, 202.3, 701.8). Cast at instant speed in Bot2's turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Witherbloom Charm
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Basalt Monolith
Island x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Island.Play
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
